WEBVTT

00:00:00.381 --> 00:00:06.996
Readers can comment under any FAQ, video or glossary term, after signing in with GitHub.

00:00:06.996 --> 00:00:10.679
Nothing appears until someone at CCS approves it.

00:00:10.679 --> 00:00:15.941
In this video, we'll approve one practice comment, and delete another.

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:25.409
When a reader submits a comment, an automatic process files it in the CMS, under Comments, marked Pending, within a minute or two.

00:00:25.409 --> 00:00:26.757
Then it's your turn.

00:00:26.757 --> 00:00:32.889
Check for pending comments regularly, because readers are told their comments are reviewed.

00:00:33.441 --> 00:00:35.963
This is the Comments collection.

00:00:35.963 --> 00:00:38.721
New comments arrive marked Pending.

00:00:39.282 --> 00:00:44.882
Filter by narrows the list to pending, approved or rejected comments.

00:00:45.433 --> 00:00:46.633
Open a comment.

00:00:46.633 --> 00:00:52.633
You'll see its status, the page it was left on, who wrote it, and the text.

00:00:53.188 --> 00:00:56.961
To approve it, set Status to approved, and publish.

00:00:56.961 --> 00:00:59.254
It's live in about two minutes.

00:00:59.254 --> 00:01:05.468
Approve comments that are on topic and civil, including ones that disagree with CCS.

00:01:06.174 --> 00:01:09.254
And here it is, under the FAQ.

00:01:09.976 --> 00:01:17.313
For comments that are off topic, or low quality, but not abusive, set the status to rejected instead.

00:01:17.313 --> 00:01:20.728
The comment stays hidden, and a record is kept.

00:01:20.728 --> 00:01:25.014
For spam, abuse, harassment or personal details, delete it.

00:01:25.014 --> 00:01:29.736
You may fix an obvious typo, but never rewrite what someone said.

00:01:30.442 --> 00:01:35.970
So, for this spam comment, open it, and click Delete entry.

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:37.282
Then click OK.

00:01:38.938 --> 00:01:40.688
It's gone from the CMS.

00:01:40.688 --> 00:01:48.295
For severe content, also ask whoever manages CCS's GitHub account to delete the original submission.

00:01:48.295 --> 00:01:52.098
Its number is in the comment's Issue number field.

00:01:52.808 --> 00:01:57.728
Next: images, the media library, and site settings.
